#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0129.1 expect=noViolation domain=SE
#note "PLAN-stopped-rule-engine-fixes item 1 (Define-XML 2.1 section 5.3.12.3: a variable may be documented at the value level only): SE.SESTDTC has no method at the variable level but every value-level entry of its def:ValueListDef (ETCD=SCREEN / TRT) carries one. The define documents the variable completely, so the rule must not fire. Fires (one finding on SESTDTC) under the rule before its var_vlm_has_method(\"DEFINE\") != true conjunct."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#define-xml CDISC-SEND-0129.1-vlm-define.xml
dataset SE
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col ETCD     type=Char
col SESTDTC  type=Char
---
S1 | S1-001 | SCREEN | 2026-01-01
S1 | S1-001 | TRT | 2026-01-08
